# Local HTTPS front for native CalDAV/CardDAV clients (ADR 0032).
#
# Terminates TLS with Caddy's built-in internal CA and reverse-proxies to the API
# container. Native Apple clients require HTTPS; trust Caddy's root CA once on the client
# (see CLAUDE.md / the deploy notes) and connect to https://localhost.
#
# The DAV surface uses relative redirects/hrefs, so no X-Forwarded-Proto handling is needed.
localhost {
	tls internal
	reverse_proxy api:9080
}
